			"widgets_values":[
				"**References:** `@[CurrentStoryboardRef]` (Part 6 storyboard), `@[PreviousVideoRef]` (Part 5 continuity), `@[CharacterA]`, `@[CharacterB]`.\n**Task:** Create Part 6 (the finale) of the high-octane ancient Chinese anime-style short film. Continue naturally from the ending of `@[PreviousVideoRef]`.\n**Continuity:** Maintain exact character identity, wardrobe, and visual consistency from `@[PreviousVideoRef]`. Transition from the high-energy explosion to a calm, moonlight-lit environment.\n**Storyboard:** Follow `@[CurrentStoryboardRef]` for story flow: The aftermath of the battle. The characters stand side by side on the stone bridge under moonlight. They share a look of mutual respect and walk away in opposite directions.\n**Story:** The dust settles. The moon rises over the ancient stone bridge. The two rivals, now showing mutual respect, exchange a nod and a smile before departing into the night.\n**Dialogue:** Silent, ambient night sounds.\n**Camera:** Slow, wide-angle cinematic shot of the bridge, followed by a gentle tracking shot of the characters walking away into the moonlight.\n**Motion:** Calm, graceful movement, gentle wind blowing through robes and hair, soft moonlight shimmering on the water.\n**Style:** High-quality anime, poetic, serene, cinematic lighting, 8k.\n**Sound:** Soft, melancholic yet hopeful traditional Chinese melody, sound of water lapping, cricket chirps.\n**Negative:** Do not show storyboard grid, panel borders, numbers, captions, arrows, labels, or poster layout. No text on screen. No subtitles. No watermark. No abrupt style change."
			],
